WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.653
In one minute, you will sign up for one email a week with the lights near you.

00:00:04.653 --> 00:00:05.729
We start on the map.

00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:08.525
Tap Places to open the list.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.742
Open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:15.742 --> 00:00:18.165
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:18.165 --> 00:00:20.654
A message asks to use your location.

00:00:20.654 --> 00:00:22.000
Tap Use my location.

00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:25.971
Your browser asks for permission.

00:00:25.971 --> 00:00:26.623
Tap Allow.

00:00:30.174 --> 00:00:32.670
Look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:32.670 --> 00:00:33.887
See the three dots?

00:00:33.887 --> 00:00:34.435
Tap them.

00:00:36.041 --> 00:00:38.619
In the menu, tap Weekly lights email.

00:00:40.353 --> 00:00:42.890
Type your email address, and your city.

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:44.602
Then tick the box to agree.

00:00:47.917 --> 00:00:48.788
Tap Sign up.

00:00:50.963 --> 00:00:52.926
We send you an email to confirm.

00:00:52.926 --> 00:00:54.710
Nothing is sent until you do.

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:55.840
Tap the link in it.

00:00:57.891 --> 00:00:58.658
That is it.

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:01.534
Every weekly email ends with a link to stop.

00:01:01.534 --> 00:01:03.708
One tap, and you are off the list.

00:01:04.908 --> 00:01:08.124
Next up: Install the app and use it offline.
